# Shape of ~/.mpco_credentials.json — NOT read from a .env file.
#
# The server loads this JSON file from your home directory:
#     ~/.mpco_credentials.json
# It is never read from this repository. Do not commit the real file.
#
# Each top-level key is an account name; `account=` on every tool selects one.
# Credentials are a Planning Center Personal Access Token: appId + secret.
#
# {
#   "myaccount": {
#     "appId": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
#     "appSecret": "pco_pat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
#   }
# }
#
# Multi-account: add more keys. The first account in the file is the fallback
# default when `account` is omitted; the server's built-in default is "unw".
